# P3 regression fixture: two triangles sharing edge v1-v2, folded 90 degrees.
# Every corner references the SAME smooth vn, so "file" mode welds to 4 vertices
# while "flat" mode must drop the vn and split the shared edge into 6.
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
v 0.0 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.70710678 0.70710678
f 1//1 2//1 3//1
f 2//1 1//1 4//1